# phase2 matrix: raw logs (tier*/) + derived report (RESULTS.md) are transient, regenerated each run.
# rundirs/ (per-cell phi.parquet + metrics.json + config + git/env provenance) IS tracked:
# small, immutable, the actual result — committing it means no re-run is ever needed for re-analysis.
runs/phase2_matrix/tier1/
runs/phase2_matrix/tier1_orig/
runs/phase2_matrix/tier2/
runs/phase2_matrix/tier3/
runs/phase2_matrix/smoke/
runs/phase2_matrix/RESULTS.md
runs/phase2_matrix/analysis/

# Track C: Slurm per-job .out logs are transient. The rundirs under runs/track_c/
# (promoted from codes/runs scratch) ARE tracked — same immutable-result convention.
slurm/logs/
